      "practice.2":[number("On a frozen frame, how many pixels should have a different winning segment ID after adding a correct conservative tile cull?",0,"Conservative culling only skips segments guaranteed to miss every pixel in the tile, and storing original IDs preserves tie-breaking—so 0 pixels may differ.")],
